; Vent (issue #315): one long floor with air doing the work. A sweeping Fan
; (#281) mid-floor lifts anyone crossing the centre, a stage-wide StageGust
; (#281) shoves everyone right every ~11 s after a 1.5 s warning, and two
; Spikes rows (#282) flank the fan. Two CrumblingLedges (#18) up high give
; somewhere to hook. Spawns are on the outer floor, clear of the spikes.
